{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine ships "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"type":"text","text":" as a stub verb, so every game already knows the word"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and answers it with a sentence. This library takes the word over and puts a body","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behind it. A swing resolves a weapon, rolls once out of a hundred against a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"per-weapon table, and spends the villain’s health; a knockout puts him on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"floor for 2 turns; the last hit prints his death line, runs the host’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDefeat"},{"text":" hook, and removes him from play — so the death line is the last thing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"said about him, and has to account for the body. The exchange a player recognizes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from Zork — swing, answer, swing — is written nowhere. It falls out of the turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pipeline: the player’s blow resolves in the command stages and the villain’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lands with the end-of-turn timers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the library claims ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".attack"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MeleeCombat(text:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is where that verb’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"voice lives. ","type":"text"},{"code":"text.stubs.attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the line a game without combat","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints, and a game with this library never prints it. The four refusals the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mechanics own — swinging at something no villain rule claimed, swinging","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bare-handed, naming a feather as a weapon, naming a sword you aren’t holding —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", passed at init."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"text":" because it saves a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ledger: each villain’s health, his stun countdown, whether he is currently in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fight, and the player’s own wounds, keyed by a string the host chooses. Nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"else belongs to it. The villains are the host’s actors, the weapons are the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host’s items carrying the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" trait, and every line"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either side speaks arrives as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","isActive":true},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which carry no defaults at all — a library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot guess a villain’s death sentence."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every roll draws from the game’s seeded stream, so a pinned seed replays a fight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"blow for blow. The guards are ordered so quiet turns draw nothing: a villain in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another room, or behind a closed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"while:"},{"text":" gate, or already engaged, burns no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"randomness, which is what keeps one villain’s presence from shifting another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"villain’s draws. Two simplifications are deliberate and want ledgering per game:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player’s wounds never heal, and a defeated villain stays defeated.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Wiring-it-in","text":"Wiring it in"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mark the weapons, register each villain in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":", and splice his"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counter-attack daemon into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoMeleeCombat","","struct Cavern: Game {","    let melee = MeleeCombat()","","    let sword = Item {","        name(\"elvish sword\")","        trait(.weapon, true)","        trait(.weaponStrength, 3)   \/\/ a keen blade: misses less, kills more","    }","    let troll = Actor { name(\"troll\") }","    let axe = Item { name(\"bloody axe\") }","    @Global var passageClear = false","","    var content: GameContents { melee }","","    var rules: Rules {","        melee.villain(","            troll, key: \"troll\", strength: 2,","            weapons: [sword],","            prose: MeleeCombat.VillainProse(","                miss: [\"The troll swings; the axe bites air.\"],","                wound: [\"Your blow lands, and the troll grunts.\"],","                knockout: \"The troll drops where he stood, out cold.\",","                \/\/ The body dissolves in the line, because the actor is","                \/\/ removed a moment later and nothing else will say so.","                death: \"The troll dies, and his body dissolves.\"),","            onDefeat: {","                passageClear = true          \/\/ unbar the door","                axe.move(to: player.location)  \/\/ and drop the loot","            })","    }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        melee.aggression(","            of: troll, key: \"troll\", daemonName: \"melee.troll\",","            strikesFirst: 33,","            prose: MeleeCombat.AggressionProse(","                miss: [\"The axe passes within an inch of your ear.\"],","                wound: [\"The axe catches your shoulder.\"],","                playerDeath: \"The troll's axe removes your head.\"))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The two calls share a ","type":"text"},{"code":"key:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and that is the whole of the connection between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A villain registered with ","type":"text"},{"code":"villain","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" alone never fights back and stays down","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for good once knocked out; one given an ","type":"text"},{"code":"aggression","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" daemon wakes up on his own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The numbers","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"The-numbers"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" slides the outcome cutpoints, out of 100.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Strength 2 is the baseline — miss ≤ 30, wound ≤ 70, knockout ≤ 85, kill above —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a plain "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights as it did"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the trait existed. Strength 1 or less is a clumsy blade at 40\/76\/90;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3 or more is a keen one at 22\/64\/82. When the player names no weapon, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keenest one he is holding serves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counter-attack rolls a flat table: miss ≤ 50, wound ≤ 85, an outright kill"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playerStrength"},{"type":"text","text":" is how many wounds the player survives, default 2."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"strikesFirst"},{"type":"text","text":" is the odds out of 100 that a villain starts a fight on a turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player hasn’t — 100 fights on sight, 0 only ever answers a blow, and neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those two values draws from the stream. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"while:"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate checked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the same-room guard, for a villain whose combat is scoped to one room; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not gate coming round from a knockout, so a man knocked out where his gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is shut still wakes up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"The-worked-example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"The worked example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"text":" wires two villains against this library. The troll is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"straightforward one: he blocks a passage, starts a fight one turn in three, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"his axe is lootable once he falls. The thief is the awkward one, and is why","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"while:"},{"text":" exists — he prowls the whole underground picking pockets and fights","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only in his own lair, so his gate is closed on almost every turn he is alive.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoMeleeCombat"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"GnustoMeleeCombat","symbolKind":"module","title":"GnustoMeleeCombat"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The attack verbs promoted to a mechanic: weapons, villain health, and a villain who answers."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"The bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/init(text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions"],"anchor":"The-bundle"},{"title":"Registering a villain","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/villain(_:key:strength:weapons:prose:onDefeat:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/aggression(of:key:daemonName:strikesFirst:playerStrength:while:prose:)"],"anchor":"Registering-a-villain"},{"title":"Traits the host declares on its items","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"],"anchor":"Traits-the-host-declares-on-its-items"},{"title":"The system’s own voice","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/init()","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/attackFutile","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/noWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/notAWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/weaponNotHeld"],"anchor":"The-systems-own-voice"},{"title":"A villain’s lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/init(miss:wound:knockout:death:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/knockout","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/death"],"anchor":"A-villains-lines"},{"title":"His counter-attack lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/init(miss:wound:playerDeath:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/playerDeath"],"anchor":"His-counter-attack-lines"}],"references":{"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/Gnusto/TraitKey/weaponStrength":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weaponStrength","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/gnusto\/traitkey\/weaponstrength","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How keen a weapon is in melee — the original’s per-weapon distinction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A higher value misses less and kills more; the outcome table reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to slide the cutpoints. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2"},{"type":"text","text":", the baseline table, so a plain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights exactly as before."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"weaponStrength"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AggressionProse"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AggressionProse"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A villain’s counter-attack lines."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"MeleeCombat.AggressionProse"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/VillainProse/miss":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"miss","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"miss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/villainprose\/miss","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/miss","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Lines rotated when the player’s blow misses."}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/CombatText/attackFutile":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/CombatText\/attackFutile","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/combattext\/attackfutile","title":"attackFutile","abstract":[{"text":"Attacking something no villain rule claimed. Handed the target’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indefinite","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" name — “a rubber raft”, not “the rubber raft” —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because a refusal aimed at a whole category of thing is the joke","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-ATTACK"},{"type":"text","text":" makes with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A ,PRSO"},{"type":"text","text":", and a line naming the category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generalizes where a definite one just repeats the command back."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attackFutile","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","text":"Line"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/actions":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"actions"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"IntentAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto12IntentActionV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/actions","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The stage-4 default for a target no villain rule claimed."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"actions"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/miss":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"miss","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"miss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose\/miss","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","abstract":[{"text":"Lines rotated when the villain’s counter-attack misses.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/Gnusto/TraitKey/weapon":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"weapon","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"weapon"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/gnusto\/traitkey\/weapon","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","abstract":[{"text":"The item can be swung at a villain.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/VillainProse":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MeleeCombat.VillainProse","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"VillainProse"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/villainprose","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VillainProse","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","abstract":[{"text":"A villain’s lines. Host-supplied per villain — these are inherently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specific, so there are no stock defaults. ","type":"text"},{"code":"miss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type